{
  "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.66,
      "size": 58608,
      "text": "相泽吸引子的外形很特别。轨道大部分时间贴着一个球面缠绕，偶尔又沿着中轴穿出去，再折回来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.06,
      "size": 64944,
      "text": "这种球面加轴向的混搭结构，在混沌吸引子里不算常见。它的方程也比洛伦兹系统复杂，光是参数就有六个。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.1,
      "size": 49680,
      "text": "但拆开看会发现，这六个参数里只有一个真正决定了它的对称性。今天就来找出那一个。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "complex",
      "line_id": "cp-1",
      "filename": "complex-cp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/complex-cp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.35,
      "size": 69552,
      "text": "先看前两个方程。横坐标的导数是 z 减 b 乘 x，再减 d 乘 y。纵坐标的导数是 d 乘 x，加上 z 减 b 乘 y。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "complex",
      "line_id": "cp-2",
      "filename": "complex-cp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/complex-cp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 5.11,
      "size": 81792,
      "text": "这个交叉的形式提示我们用复数。令 w 等于 x 加 i 乘 y，那么两个方程合成一个：w 的导数等于 z 减 b 加上 i 乘 d，整体乘以 w。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "complex",
      "line_id": "cp-3",
      "filename": "complex-cp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/complex-cp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.4,
      "size": 70416,
      "text": "这不是近似，是恒等式。屏幕上验证的误差精确为零。实部 z 减 b 控制径向的胀缩，虚部 d 控制绕轴的旋转速率。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "rotation",
      "line_id": "rt-1",
      "filename": "rotation-rt-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/rotation-rt-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54144,
      "text": "有了复数形式，轴对称就好判断了。绕 z 轴旋转，在复数语言里就是乘以一个模为一的复数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "rotation",
      "line_id": "rt-2",
      "filename": "rotation-rt-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/rotation-rt-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.22,
      "size": 67536,
      "text": "严格的说法叫旋转等变：先旋转再求导，和先求导再旋转，结果必须完全一样。这两条路径的差就是等变误差。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "rotation",
      "line_id": "rt-3",
      "filename": "rotation-rt-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/rotation-rt-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.04,
      "size": 48672,
      "text": "前两个方程天然满足这一点，因为它们只依赖 w 本身。问题出在第三个方程。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "breaker",
      "line_id": "bk-1",
      "filename": "breaker-bk-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/breaker-bk-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.73,
      "size": 59760,
      "text": "第三个方程大部分项都只依赖 z 和 x 平方加 y 平方，也就是只依赖到轴的距离，这些项都不破坏对称。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "breaker",
      "line_id": "bk-2",
      "filename": "breaker-bk-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/breaker-bk-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.28,
      "size": 68544,
      "text": "唯一的例外是最后那项，f 乘 z 乘 x 的三次方。它单独依赖 x，而不是依赖 x 平方加 y 平方，所以随旋转而变。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "breaker",
      "line_id": "bk-3",
      "filename": "breaker-bk-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/breaker-bk-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.14,
      "size": 66240,
      "text": "把 f 调成零，等变误差降到十的负十六次方，系统严格轴对称。f 一旦非零，误差立刻跳到十的负二次方量级。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-1",
      "filename": "verify-vf-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "size": 59904,
      "text": "请拖动 f 滑块，观察吸引子形状的变化。f 等于零时它是一个完美的回转体，绕轴任意角度看都一样。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-2",
      "filename": "verify-vf-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.9,
      "size": 62352,
      "text": "f 加大到零点一，回转对称消失，吸引子出现明显的方向性。继续加大到零点二五，不对称更加显著。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-3",
      "filename": "verify-vf-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.19,
      "size": 67104,
      "text": "同时留意李雅普诺夫指数读数。标准参数下约为零点零七六，为正，确认这是真正的混沌而非复杂的周期运动。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.61,
      "size": 41760,
      "text": "第一，前两个方程可以合成一个复数方程，实部管胀缩，虚部管旋转。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.48,
      "size": 39744,
      "text": "第二，旋转等变性是轴对称的严格判据，可以算出具体的误差数值。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "aizawa-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/aizawa-attractor/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.92,
      "size": 62784,
      "text": "第三，六个参数里只有 f 破坏轴对称，因为只有它依赖 x 而非到轴距离。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
